OL,3,AUK net migration falls to 77,000 in
OL,4,Ayear to June 2026 - lowest since 1997,
OL,5,Aoutside pandemic
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, Home Office figures show
OL,8,F74,000 people claimed asylum in the UK
OL,9,Fin the year ending September 2026 - a
OL,10,Fthird fewer than the previous year
OL,12,FThe number of people applying for
OL,13,FBritish citizenship reached a "record
OL,14,Fhigh" of 320,000 in the same year, with
OL,15,FIndian and Pakistani nationals
OL,16,Fremaining the largest groups granted
OL,17,Fcitizenship
